      "text": "A man thinks his wife is going deaf.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The doctor tells him: ask her something from behind, and see how close you have to get before she answers.",
